#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-shutter-with-servo.rst:5
#: 31b854ea4e1f4a6f90d2b19a9287f5fc
msgid "Camera Shutter Configuration"
msgstr "相机快门配置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-shutter-with-servo.rst:7
#: 5acf828fab50455281822306079e3d5c
msgid ""
"ArduPilot allows you to configure a :ref:`servo output<common-servo>` or "
":ref:`relay<common-relay>` to control a camera trigger from :ref:`an RC "
"transmitter, a ground station or during a mission <common-camera-controls>`."
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot 允许您配置 :ref:`舵机输出<common-servo>` 或 :ref:`继电器<common-relay>` 来控制来自 "
":ref:`遥控器、地面站或任务 <common-camera-controls>` 的相机触发器。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-shutter-with-servo.rst:9
#: 7442e68e378c46d1af7cee6821e7da8a
msgid ""
"This article explains in general what connections and settings are required "
"but in most cases the autopilot's servo output or relay voltage will be "
"converted into a format understood by the particular camera used and the "
"setup details will depend upon what hardware is used (infrared, cable, etc)."
"  These two pages may provide more details"
msgstr ""
"本文总体介绍所需的连接和设置，但在大多数情况下，飞控的舵机输出或继电器电压需转换为特定相机可识别的格式，具体设置取决于所用硬件（红外、数据线等）。以下两页可提供更多详情"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-shutter-with-servo.rst:11
#: 404058dc1bd9453daa98e97c16840cc3
msgid ""
":ref:`DIY article for a Pixhawk using a relay based trigger<common-pixhawk-"
"camera-trigger-setup>`"
msgstr ":ref:`Pixhawk 继电器式相机触发 DIY 文章 <common-pixhawk-camera-trigger-setup>`"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-shutter-with-servo.rst:14
#: 9e13e93ff0b64251bfde67a921c19bc8
msgid "Servo control connection and configuration"
msgstr "舵机控制连接和配置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-shutter-with-servo.rst:16
#: 4cc6b879aba34a4692e739fa10f719c7
msgid ""
"Connect one of the autopilot's PWM output (aka servo outputs) to the camera "
"or the camera control cable that accepts PWM input. As mentioned on the "
":ref:`servos wiki page <common-servo>` there are some autopilot specific "
"limitations on which PWM outputs may be used:"
msgstr ""
"将飞控的某个 PWM 输出（即舵机输出）连接到相机或接受 PWM 输入的相机控制线。如 :ref:`舵机 wiki 页面 <common-servo>`"
" 所述，对于可用的 PWM 输出存在一些飞控特定限制："

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-shutter-with-servo.rst:19
#: 4998c1f33ef24a95a5cccc3fb4dc1c44
msgid ""
"For autopilots with IOMCU (e.g. label outputs as MAIN OUT and AUX OUT), it "
"is easiest to use AUX OUT 1 to 6."
msgstr "对于带有 IOMCU 的飞控（例如标有 MAIN OUT 和 AUX OUT），建议使用 AUX OUT 1 至 6。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-shutter-with-servo.rst:20
#: baec8d9150104f93993b1d6f99cd11c5
msgid "For autopilots without an IOMCU any output may be used"
msgstr "对于不带 IOMCU 的飞控，可使用任意输出"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-shutter-with-servo.rst:22
#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-shutter-with-servo.rst:38
#: 1ab171a26d594d3793aedc429ef10829 bff61e9dd99e476abb24799c7ae701f0
msgid "Configure the autopilot by setting these parameters:"
msgstr "通过设置以下参数来配置飞控："

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-shutter-with-servo.rst:24
#: 0bfc188945a14c9880c9e149bd01f515
msgid ""
"Set `SERVOx_FUNCTION` = 10 (CameraTrigger) where \"x\" is the PWM output "
"connected to the camera"
msgstr "设置 `SERVOx_FUNCTION` = 10（CameraTrigger），其中「x」为连接到相机的 PWM 输出"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-shutter-with-servo.rst:25
#: 3b9d627d6f6e45df876ed37e7e1f2be0
msgid "Set :ref:`CAM1_TYPE<CAM1_TYPE>` = 1 (Servo) and reboot the autopilot"
msgstr "设置 :ref:`CAM1_TYPE<CAM1_TYPE>` = 1（Servo），然后重启飞控"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-shutter-with-servo.rst:26
#: 78cde66cdfee4788bdb4491384b1d401
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`CAM1_SERVO_ON<CAM1_SERVO_ON>` to the pwm value to output to "
"trigger taking a picture (e.g. 1300)"
msgstr "设置 :ref:`CAM1_SERVO_ON<CAM1_SERVO_ON>` 为触发拍照时输出的 PWM 值（例如 1300）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-shutter-with-servo.rst:27
#: 7c121d67e8444d8a9efd86f892c2a1db
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`CAM1_SERVO_OFF<CAM1_SERVO_OFF>` to the pwm value to output when "
"*not* taking a picture (e.g. 1100)"
msgstr "设置 :ref:`CAM1_SERVO_OFF<CAM1_SERVO_OFF>` 为*非*拍照时输出的 PWM 值（例如 1100）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-shutter-with-servo.rst:28
#: 9bba33b6e4244c109dba496c66720d7b
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`CAM1_DURATION<CAM1_DURATION>` to the time (in seconds) that the "
"pwm value should remain high (e.g 0.1)"
msgstr "设置 :ref:`CAM1_DURATION<CAM1_DURATION>` 为 PWM 值保持高位的时间（单位：秒，例如 0.1）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-shutter-with-servo.rst:31
#: 3ad1e9663cc941bbb707484a9494473c
msgid "Relay control connection and configuration"
msgstr "继电器控制连接和配置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-shutter-with-servo.rst:34
#: 904de72f2b4c47f681b1176b0749eb48
msgid ""
":ref:`This function is a GPIO and has limited current capabilities.<gpio-"
"warning>`"
msgstr ":ref:`此功能为 GPIO，电流能力有限。<gpio-warning>`"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-shutter-with-servo.rst:36
#: 6036ff5ee3184ad69aff2371d1afc639
msgid ""
"Connect one of the autopilot's GPIO pins to the camera or the camera control"
" cable that accepts high/low voltage input.  As mentioned on the :ref:`relay"
" wiki page<common-relay>` the autopilot's servo/motor outputs can normally "
"be used but, in addition, some autopilots have dedicated pins purely for use"
" as relays/GPIOs."
msgstr ""
"将飞控的某个 GPIO 引脚连接到相机或接受高/低电压输入的相机控制线。如 :ref:`继电器 wiki 页面<common-relay>` "
"所述，通常可使用飞控的舵机/电机输出，此外部分飞控还专门设有用于继电器/GPIO 的引脚。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-shutter-with-servo.rst:40
#: 444be895445b4464a7cddec41ae668c2
msgid ""
"If using 4.5 (or earlier) only the 1st relay can be used so set "
"``RELAY_PIN`` to the GPIO pin used"
msgstr "如果使用 4.5（或更早版本），只能使用第 1 路继电器，因此将 ``RELAY_PIN`` 设置为所用 GPIO 引脚"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-shutter-with-servo.rst:41
#: 3eaaf1d0c7cd4217bb811191e52bd5e0
msgid ""
"If using 4.6 (or higher) any relay can be used.  Below are settings if the "
"first relay is used."
msgstr "如果使用 4.6（或更高版本），可使用任意继电器。以下为使用第一路继电器时的设置。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-shutter-with-servo.rst:43
#: f64ddb42b54640a7b6688659e675e7a9
msgid "Set :ref:`RELAY1_FUNCTION<RELAY1_FUNCTION>` = 4 (Camera)"
msgstr "设置 :ref:`RELAY1_FUNCTION<RELAY1_FUNCTION>` = 4（Camera）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-shutter-with-servo.rst:44
#: 73317ee7e9274382b5dd368402744a5f
msgid "Set :ref:`RELAY1_PIN<RELAY1_PIN>` to the GPIO pin used"
msgstr "设置 :ref:`RELAY1_PIN<RELAY1_PIN>` 为所用 GPIO 引脚"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-shutter-with-servo.rst:46
#: 9fdba41734d44e29bf3856dd785860b1
msgid ""
"Set ``SERVOx_FUNCTION`` = -1 (GPIO) where \"x\" is the servo output channel "
"used.  This is not required in the rare case where an autopilot's dedicated "
"GPIO pins are used."
msgstr ""
"设置 ``SERVOx_FUNCTION`` = -1（GPIO），其中「x」为所用舵机输出通道。在极少数使用飞控专用 GPIO "
"引脚的情况下，无需此设置。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-shutter-with-servo.rst:47
#: fde65713d1fe4b7a85607464a998607b
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`CAM1_DURATION<CAM1_DURATION>` to the time (in seconds) that the "
"relay is held high"
msgstr "设置 :ref:`CAM1_DURATION<CAM1_DURATION>` 为继电器保持高位的时间（单位：秒）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-shutter-with-servo.rst:48
#: 448aebd3402f4dceb90f22563f282479
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`CAM1_RELAY_ON<CAM1_RELAY_ON>` = 0 to swap the relay voltage.  E.g."
" GPIO output would now be normally high by default, and then low to trigger "
"the camera shutter"
msgstr ""
"设置 :ref:`CAM1_RELAY_ON<CAM1_RELAY_ON>` = 0 以反转继电器电压。例如，GPIO "
"输出默认为高电平，触发相机快门时变为低电平"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-shutter-with-servo.rst:53
#: 6b3d11ec034d47c297d1ddf3c3e02590
msgid "Camera shutter feedback logging"
msgstr "相机快门反馈日志"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-shutter-with-servo.rst:55
#: efb50974c97f4e579ebc2df35a970471
msgid ""
"ArduPilot logs TRIG messages when it *triggers* the camera.  If the camera "
"provides a GPIO output (e.g. camera flash hotshoe) then this can be used to "
"also log CAM messages at the exact moment that pictures are taken."
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot 在*触发*相机时记录 TRIG 消息。如果相机提供 GPIO 输出（例如相机闪光灯热靴），则可用于在拍照的精确时刻记录 CAM "
"消息。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-shutter-with-servo.rst:57
#: 485d0a46a2e24d10a3bbec65513939d9
msgid ""
"Connect the camera's GPIO output  to one of the autopilot's :ref:`GPIO pins "
"<common-gpios>` (e.g. AUX OUT).  As mentioned above there are restrictions "
"on which pins may be used."
msgstr ""
"将相机的 GPIO 输出连接到飞控的某个 :ref:`GPIO 引脚 <common-gpios>` （例如 AUX "
"OUT）。如上所述，可用引脚有限制。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-shutter-with-servo.rst:59
#: 19196943b1264dc4afe393ad26d33d0f
msgid "Set the following parameters:"
msgstr "设置以下参数："

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-shutter-with-servo.rst:61
#: f2d7acb7342a45a88af7590a3d9b7a04
msgid ""
"Set `SERVOx_FUNCTION` = -1 (GPIO) where \"x\" is the servo output channel "
"used.  This is not required in the rare case where the autopilot's dedicated"
" GPIO pins are useds"
msgstr ""
"设置 `SERVOx_FUNCTION` = -1（GPIO），其中「x」为所用舵机输出通道。在极少数使用飞控专用 GPIO 引脚的情况下，无需此设置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-shutter-with-servo.rst:62
#: 8a883f9c51e74e239554284972b9827b
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`CAM1_FEEDBAK_PIN<CAM1_FEEDBAK_PIN>` to the pin number connected to"
" the hotshoe"
msgstr "设置 :ref:`CAM1_FEEDBAK_PIN<CAM1_FEEDBAK_PIN>` 为连接到热靴的引脚编号"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-shutter-with-servo.rst:63
#: 3ef25ebc3f2a4e64857959d648ebb6dd
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`CAM1_FEEDBAK_POL<CAM1_FEEDBAK_POL>` = 0 if the hotshoe voltage "
"goes low when a picture is taken or 1 if the voltage goes high"
msgstr "设置 :ref:`CAM1_FEEDBAK_POL<CAM1_FEEDBAK_POL>` = 0（拍照时热靴电压变低）或 1（电压变高）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-shutter-with-servo.rst:65
#: 9167a3cd95b84ae185012a1ecb81325d
msgid ""
"See :ref:`digital input pin <common-pixhawk-"
"overview_pixhawk_digital_outputs_and_inputs_virtual_pins_50-55>` for more "
"details."
msgstr ""
"详见 :ref:`数字输入引脚 <common-pixhawk-"
"overview_pixhawk_digital_outputs_and_inputs_virtual_pins_50-55>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-shutter-with-servo.rst:67
#: 80c8646daf8e46c3acaff24b2ed492ac
msgid ""
"Consider using the `Seagulls SYNC2 Shoe Horn Adapter "
"<https://www.seagulluav.com/product/seagull-sync2/>`__"
msgstr ""
"建议使用 `Seagulls SYNC2 Shoe Horn Adapter "
"<https://www.seagulluav.com/product/seagull-sync2/>`__"
